Use the system "twitter hovercard" proposed by twitter wordrpess on your site.

== Description ==

Use the system "twitter hovercard" proposed by twitter wordrpess on your site.
Hovercard Twitter allows you to view the profile of each @twitter_profil (hover) that you will add in the various pages / posts your website.
The plugin is Extremely easy to use & offers a great value added.

More informations [twitter card](https://dev.twitter.com/docs/cards) & [content tagged with twitter card](https://dev.twitter.com/tags/twitter-cards)

PS: question, [eewee.fr](http://www.eewee.fr).

* See the [Changelog](http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/eewee-twitter-hovercard/changelog/) for what's new.

== Installation ==

1. Download the plugin Zip archive.
1. Upload plugin folder to your '/wp-content/plugins/' directory
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress

